<title>USA: Gentex wins Mitsubishi mirror contract.</title>
<headline>Gentex wins Mitsubishi mirror contract.</headline>
<dateline>ZEELAND, Mich. 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gentex Corp said it recently began shipping its automatic-dimming interior mirror for Mitsubishi Motors Corp.'s new 1997 Diamante sedan.</p>
<p>The Australian-built Diamante is the first Mitsubishi vehicle to offer Gentex's Night Vision Safety automatic-dimming rearview mirror. The mirror is standard equipment on all upper grade Mitsubishi Diamante vehicles imported to North America, Gentex said.</p>
</text>
